  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Levittown, PA\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Levittown, PA\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nLevittown, PA\nSpecialty and 24/7 Emergency\n215.750.7884\n301 Veterans Hwy.\nLevittown, PA 19056\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nBy appointment\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – serving Philadelphia and Delaware.\nWe are located in Levittown in Bucks County and serve pets and their families in greater Philadelphia, the Delaware Valley, Trenton and nearby communities.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our team is ready to provide expert care 24/7 in case of a pet emergency. If your pet requires a veterinary specialist, we are ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nIn an emergency, call ahead to your BluePearl vet and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary for our emergency vet.\nLearn more about your emergency visit.\nSpecialty care\nOur veterinary specialists work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nLearn more about veterinary specialists.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Levittown.\nOur Levittown hospital opened in 2011 and features a CT scanner, MRI machine, an intensive care unit, a linear accelerator for radiation therapy, separate canine and feline wards and more. We also offer radioiodine I-131 treatment for cats with hyperthyroidism.\nWe frequently share our medical expertise by inviting primary care veterinarians to educational events at our hospital.\nBluePearl Levittown has been named a National Trauma Center, which puts it in an elite group of veterinary hospitals. And in 2017, our Levittown location was named “Practice of the Year” in a nationwide competition.\nPet owners\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n215.750.7884\nor\n[email protected]\nIn 2026, our hospital received accreditation as a VECCS Level I Certified Facility, marking a significant milestone in enhancing patient care standards.\nThe Veterinary Emergency & Critical Care Society (VECCS) is a global professional organization comprising of veterinarians, veterinary technicians, and practice managers committed to advancing knowledge and upholding superior standards in veterinary emergency and critical care. The purpose of this certification is to recognize those hospitals that meet and exceed the minimum standards and guidelines published by VECCS. VECCS does this in the hopes of raising the standard of care while also increasing public and professional awareness in veterinary emergency and critical patient care.\nI-131 Required Diagnostics\nDownload Form\nI-131 Information\nDownload Form\nI-131 Discharge Instructions\nDownload Form\nCurrent location.\n215.750.7884\n215.752.3156\n301 Veterans Hwy.\nLevittown,\nPA                                    19056\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nLanghorne, PA\n2010 Cabot Blvd. W, Ste. D\nLanghorne, PA 19047\n215.750.2774\n2.21 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nPhiladelphia, PA\n1114 S Front St.\nPhiladelphia, PA 19147\n267.800.1950\n20.69 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nConshohocken, PA\n625 Ridge Pike, Bldg. B\nConshohocken, PA 19428\n484.567.7999\n21.57 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
